# AI worker (`apps/ai`)

Docs: `doc/features/ai-async-jobs.md`, `packages/ai-contracts/README.md`.

## Conventions

- Job shapes live in `@saas-boilerplate/ai-contracts` — update contracts before worker/API drift.
- API enqueues; Flask consumes Redis Streams and updates durable `AiJob` rows.
- Keep default/stub processors offline-friendly for local/dev; don’t require paid APIs in tests.
- Respect existing env flags for real model backends (e.g. Ollama) vs stubs.
